  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Stringer 'The Null' Nullson was born amidst the rusted husks of Subchain City. He found an ancient guitar in the ruins and discovered it could channel the city's hidden energies, becoming a wandering minstrel and reluctant hero. He might be a ghost, or he might just reek of old ethernet cables.",
